# The Linux VM guest image, pinned by digest and signed with the
# release key. Pinned from what a release published; `tilo-linux-vm` compiles
# it in and fetches nothing else.
#
# Images publish only from stable, and no stable release has published under
# the guest's new name yet: until one does, this pins the last image
# published, under the name it was published as. The release that publishes
# under `linux-guest` moves the pin to that name (its run prints the line in
# pins.env) and drops `legacy-guest` from the accepted repositories.
LINUX_GUEST_X86_64_REF=registry.tilo.so/tilo/legacy-guest@sha256:811a3dfb35365ff9b5776822575e936f160f145937ffb6c990eb9752c86c8dd0
